      "title": "How to read this workflow",
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# How strong is the anchor?\n\nThe same anchor, prompt and seed through **NoobAI XL** at four denoise levels. Low denoise copies the anchor; high denoise lets the model invent.\n\n- `0.35` \u2014 nearly a copy\n- `0.55` \u2014 stylised, same scene\n- `0.75` \u2014 the model's prior takes over\n- `0.95` \u2014 the anchor is only a layout hint\n\nOutputs are saved to `outputs/ladder/`."
      ]
    }
